nfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GATV5","createdAt":"2024-07-24T14:53:33Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-24T14:53:33Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-24T14:53:33Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GArZG","createdAt":"2024-07-24T15:36:51Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-24T15:36:51Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-24T15:36:51Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GAssI","createdAt":"2024-07-24T15:39:29Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-24T15:39:29Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-24T15:39:29Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GF-67","createdAt":"2024-07-25T08:06:50Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-25T08:06:50Z","lastEditedAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"editor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb"},"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":2,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpHOS7_t4A=="},"nodes":[{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6GF-67zku_7eE","createdAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","editedAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","editor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"Customizing iOS native components is tricky, they don't give the same freedom as Compose.\r\nFor now what I managed to do is:\r\n- `containerColor`: Will update the background color of the picker\r\n- ~`selectedDayContentColor`: Will update the tint color~\r\n- `selectedDayContainerColor`: Will update the tint color\r\n- `dayContentColor`: Currently only white and black are supported (Handled by the component theme), when you choose a color, I will look if it's more white or black and then set the theme of the date picker which will change the text color accordingly.\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\nDatePickerDefaults.colors(\r\n    selectedDayContainerColor = Color.Red,\r\n    dayContentColor = Color.DarkGray,\r\n    containerColor = Color.LightGray\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"407\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-25 at 8 59 41 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa14317d-b2d3-4b99-b932-cc39b6d9f04e\">\r\n\r\nThis will be available in the next release and the [snapshot](https://mohamedrejeb.github.io/Calf/installation/#snapshots) version.\r\n"},{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6GF-67zku_7eA","createdAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T17:51:06Z","editedAt":"2024-07-25T08:06:50Z","editor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"Customizing iOS native components is tricky, they don't give the same freedom as Compose.\r\nFor now what I managed to do is:\r\n- `containerColor`: Will update the background color of the picker\r\n- `selectedDayContentColor`: Will update the tint color\r\n- `dayContentColor`: Currently only white and black are supported (Handled by the component theme), when you choose a color, I will look if it's more white or black and then set the theme of the date picker which will change the text color accordingly.\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\nDatePickerDefaults.colors(\r\n    selectedDayContentColor = Color.Red,\r\n    dayContentColor = Color.DarkGray,\r\n    containerColor = Color.LightGray\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"407\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-25 at 8 59 41 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa14317d-b2d3-4b99-b932-cc39b6d9f04e\">\r\n\r\nThis will be available in the next release and the [snapshot](https://mohamedrejeb.github.io/Calf/installation/#snapshots) version.\r\n"}]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GF3ez","createdAt":"2024-07-25T07:50:59Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T07:50:59Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-25T07:50:59Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GGEpk","createdAt":"2024-07-25T08:17:50Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-25T08:17:50Z","lastEditedAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"editor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb"},"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":2,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpHOS7Kz4Q=="},"nodes":[{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6GGEpkzkuys-M","createdAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","editedAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","editor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"I will try `confirmValueChange`, what I tried is changing `skipPartiallyExpanded` and the sheet value was changed to `Hidden` and then changed back to `HalfExpanded` or `Expanded` depends on the value of `skipPartiallyExpanded`.\r\nAfter this fix, the sheet value stays correct."},{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6GGEpkzkuys-E","createdAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T08:18:12Z","editedAt":"2024-07-25T08:17:50Z","editor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"I will try `confirmValueChange`, what I tried is changing `skipPartiallyExpanded` and the sheet value was changed to `Hidden` and then changed back to `HalfExpanded` or `Expanded` depends on the value of `skipPartiallyExpanded`.\r\nAfter this change, the sheet value stays correct."}]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6GGP90","createdAt":"2024-07-25T08:39:27Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-25T08:39:27Z","publishedAt":"2024-07-25T08:39